xpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-12T06:16:38-08:00","id":310129,"title":"","content":"Bummer! The last two kickstarters I backed actually allowed you to pay for additional add-ons during the survey process so I was hoping onyx path's may be similar. As I said it was long shot but if anyone finds that they can buy additional books and remember this thread that would be awesome! It's not the end of the world but the initial despair at seeing the kickstarter was over was palpable. Lol. I really wanted this one of all the others. It may have to be ebay after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4267-cabala","name":"cabala","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}